00:25:17,287 --> 00:25:19,289
FOR WHAT I WANTED
OUT OF CHRISTINA,

668
00:25:19,289 --> 00:25:20,157
SHE GAVE IT TO ME.

669
00:25:20,557 --> 00:25:22,159
SHE'S GOT
A BEAUTIFUL FACE.

670
00:25:22,326 --> 00:25:23,493
TATIANA,
WE'RE GONNA DO ONE SIDE

671
00:25:23,493 --> 00:25:24,661
AND THEN WE'RE GONNA
SHOOT THE OTHER SIDE,

672
00:25:24,661 --> 00:25:26,630
SO WHAT YOU NEED TO DO
IS YOU'RE GONNA TRY

673
00:25:26,630 --> 00:25:28,966
AND REACH OUT YOUR PALM FLAT
SO THAT WE CAN DIGITALLY

674
00:25:28,966 --> 00:25:30,200
PUT THE TWO PALMS TOGETHER.

675
00:25:31,335 --> 00:25:32,769
DON'T TURN
WITH YOUR SHOULDERS.

676
00:25:32,769 --> 00:25:35,872
KEEP YOUR SHOULDERS STRAIGHT
AND SINK BACK INTO IT.

677
00:25:36,573 --> 00:25:37,908
TRUST THE HARNESS.

678
00:25:38,475 --> 00:25:39,743
BRING UP THAT KNEE
A LITTLE BIT MORE.

679
00:25:39,743 --> 00:25:41,245
TATIANA STRUGGLED
A LITTLE.

680
00:25:41,378 --> 00:25:42,646
YOU'VE GOTTA
TRUST THE HARNESS.

681
00:25:44,147 --> 00:25:45,716
YOU'RE A LONG
WAY OFF, HONEY.

682
00:25:45,716 --> 00:25:47,784
SO I'M LIKE
THE LONGEST ONE, HUH?

683
00:25:47,784 --> 00:25:48,785
WELL, YEAH.

684
00:25:48,785 --> 00:25:50,454
HE'S JUST
STRAIGHT TO THE POINT.

685
00:25:50,454 --> 00:25:52,689
THEY WERE TAKING LONG
TO GET TO ME AND I WAS

686
00:25:52,689 --> 00:25:54,191
GETTING, LIKE, IMPATIENT.

687
00:25:55,559 --> 00:25:57,527
YOURS IS ABOUT FLYING.

688
00:25:59,263 --> 00:26:00,197
CHIN'S A LITTLE HIGH.

689
00:26:01,198 --> 00:26:03,000
REBECCA IS
VERY COMFORTABLE ON THE WIRE.

690
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:04,768
I JUST WISH REBECCA
WOULD GIVE ME

691
00:26:04,768 --> 00:26:06,470
A LITTLE MORE EXPRESSION.

692
00:26:06,470 --> 00:26:08,138
THIS IS LOOKING
A LITTLE AWKWARD RIGHT NOW.

693
00:26:08,138 --> 00:26:10,741
GO UP AND JUST,
KIND OF JUST GO-- AND POUR IT.

694
00:26:10,741 --> 00:26:13,110
THINK OF IT AS YOUR INFANT
AND YOU'RE JUST CRADLING--

695
00:26:13,110 --> 00:26:14,144
THERE YOU GO, SWEETIE.

696
00:26:14,778 --> 00:26:15,545
THIS ONE'S GOOD.

697
00:26:16,280 --> 00:26:17,614
- GREAT JOB.
- THAT WAS ACTUALLY

698
00:26:17,614 --> 00:26:19,149
MICHELLE'S BEST SHOOT.

699
00:26:20,217 --> 00:26:21,585
THAT WAS FUN.
I'M LIKING THAT.

700
00:26:26,757 --> 00:26:28,759
NOW REALLY DIVE
WITH THOSE ARMS, SWEETIE.

701
00:26:29,126 --> 00:26:31,728
DIVE WITH THOSE ARMS LIKE
YOU'RE DIVING INTO THE WATER.

702
00:26:32,396 --> 00:26:33,964
LLUVY, TAKE YOUR HANDS
TO THE OTHER SIDE FOR ME.

703
00:26:34,531 --> 00:26:35,432
I'M A TANGLED FISH.

704
00:26:35,899 --> 00:26:37,901
LLUVY STRUGGLED A LOT
IN THE HARNESS TODAY,

705
00:26:38,001 --> 00:26:40,904
A LITTLE INSECURE
ABOUT HER WHOLE OVERALL POSE.

706
00:26:41,138 --> 00:26:42,706
AND YOU CAN
TRY DIFFERENT THINGS,

707
00:26:42,706 --> 00:26:45,108
BUT AS LONG AS YOU KEEP
THAT KIND OF FISHY MOTION

708
00:26:45,108 --> 00:26:46,376
WITH THE HANDS TOGETHER...

709
00:26:46,543 --> 00:26:49,546
SHE HAD A REALLY HARD TIME
REALLY GRASPING

710
00:26:49,746 --> 00:26:50,747
THE SHAPE THAT WE WANTED.

711
00:26:51,014 --> 00:26:51,882
THANK YOU, GUYS.

712
00:26:52,349 --> 00:26:54,484
THE ONLY THING, LIKE,
I DISAGREE WITH RIGHT NOW

713
00:26:54,484 --> 00:26:57,220
IS THE FACT THAT
BRANDY THREATENED TATIANA.

714
00:26:57,220 --> 00:26:58,689
EVERYBODY'S TALKING
ABOUT SOMETHING THAT

715
00:26:58,689 --> 00:26:59,556
HAPPENED THE OTHER DAY.

716
00:26:59,923 --> 00:27:01,091
AND IF WE COULD HIT PEOPLE,
YOUR ASS WOULD BE

717
00:27:01,091 --> 00:27:02,092
TORE UP RIGHT NOW.

718
00:27:02,092 --> 00:27:03,727
TATIANA DO GOT
A SLICK MOUTH.

719
00:27:04,061 --> 00:27:05,329
I'M SAYING IT
RIGHT HERE IN FRONT OF YOU.

720
00:27:05,329 --> 00:27:06,663
YEAH, YOU DO, OKAY?

721
00:27:06,663 --> 00:27:08,398
SO TWO PEOPLE WITH
TWO SLICK MOUTHS ARE GONNA GET

722
00:27:08,398 --> 00:27:09,399
INTO TROUBLE
WITH EACH OTHER.

723
00:27:09,399 --> 00:27:10,534
BUT I DIDN'T THREATEN HER.

724
00:27:10,767 --> 00:27:12,936
PERSONALLY, I HAVE NO IDEA
WHAT BRANDY HAS AGAINST ME,

725
00:27:12,936 --> 00:27:15,172
BUT BRANDY'S NOT SOMEBODY
I WANNA GET ALONG WITH

726
00:27:15,172 --> 00:27:16,640
OR EVEN TRY
TO BE HER FRIEND.

727
00:27:16,873 --> 00:27:17,974
IF SHE DIDN'T
SAY SOMETHING TO ME,

728
00:27:17,974 --> 00:27:18,975
I WOULDN'T HAVE TO
STAND UP FOR MYSELF.

729
00:27:19,543 --> 00:27:21,144
WELL, I DON'T KNOW, I'M NOT
BRANDY, BUT, LIKE I SAID,

730
00:27:21,144 --> 00:27:22,779
SHE'S NOT GONNA JUST SIT THERE
AND LET NOBODY TALK ABOUT HER.

731
00:27:23,246 --> 00:27:26,950
BRANDY IS SWEET 90% OF THE TIME,
BUT WHEN YOU HAVE

732
00:27:26,950 --> 00:27:30,253
BITCHY GIRLS LIKE TATIANA
THROWIN' FIRE AT BRANDY,

733
00:27:30,654 --> 00:27:31,988
OF COURSE SHE'S GONNA
GET AN ATTITUDE.

734
00:27:32,356 --> 00:27:33,390
BRANDY'S NOT NO LITTLE GIRL.

735
00:27:33,390 --> 00:27:34,891
SHE'S GONNA
STAND UP FOR HERSELF.

736
00:27:36,560 --> 00:27:37,828
I KNOW
IT'S THE END OF THE DAY.

737
00:27:37,828 --> 00:27:39,262
I DON'T NEED TIRED.

738
00:27:39,262 --> 00:27:40,297
- OKAY.
- ALL RIGHT?

739
00:27:40,864 --> 00:27:42,499
CAN YOU LEAN
INTO THE HARNESS?

740
00:27:42,499 --> 00:27:43,800
BECAUSE, RIGHT NOW,
WHAT YOU'RE DOING--

741
00:27:43,800 --> 00:27:45,535
YOU COULD BE STANDING UP THERE
WITHOUT A HARNESS.

742
00:27:45,535 --> 00:27:47,771
DO YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN?
I NEED IT TO LOOK MORE SURREAL.

743
00:27:49,272 --> 00:27:50,307
THINK OF DANCE.

744
00:27:50,874 --> 00:27:52,209
OOH, WAIT A MINUTE.

745
00:27:52,209 --> 00:27:53,310
I'M ABOUT TO FALL.

746
00:27:53,310 --> 00:27:55,011
NO, YOU'RE NOT.
YOU'RE NOT GOIN' ANYWHERE.

747
00:27:55,245 --> 00:27:57,948
I JUST WISH BRANDY WOULD
TAKE COMMAND OF THAT HARNESS

748
00:27:57,948 --> 00:28:00,784
AND JUST, KIND OF, LASH OUT,
KIND OF LIKE A SCORPION WOULD.

749
00:28:00,784 --> 00:28:01,485
YOU GOT IT, BABY.

750
00:28:01,785 --> 00:28:03,887
AFTER
YESTERDAY'S CONFRONTATION,

751
00:28:03,887 --> 00:28:06,556
I KNOW IT'S GONNA BE
A LOT OF HATIN' BEHIND MY BACK,

752
00:28:06,556 --> 00:28:08,024
BUT I'M JUST GONNA
PUT IT LIKE THIS--

753
00:28:08,158 --> 00:28:10,927
I'M HERE,
AND SO NOW LET THE GAMES BEGIN.

754
00:28:11,128 --> 00:28:13,063
I WAS-- OKAY--
IT'S OKAY.

755
00:28:13,063 --> 00:28:14,331
YOU APOLOGIZED
TO ME YESTERDAY,

756
00:28:14,331 --> 00:28:15,866
AND I APOLOGIZED TO YOU.

757
00:28:15,866 --> 00:28:17,801
YEAH, THEN YOU GO OFF AGAIN.

758
00:28:17,801 --> 00:28:20,504
NO, AND THEN YOU KEEP ON
BUMPIN' BEHIND MY BACK.

759
00:28:20,504 --> 00:28:21,772
YOU THREATENED ME.

760
00:28:21,772 --> 00:28:23,206
DON'T GET IN MY FACE.

761
00:28:23,206 --> 00:28:25,175
I'M PULLING BRANDY BECAUSE
BRANDY'S IN TATIANA'S FACE

762
00:28:25,175 --> 00:28:26,376
LIKE SHE'S GONNA HIT HER.

763
00:28:26,576 --> 00:28:30,046
I DON'T WANT BRANDY TO GET
KICKED OUT OF THE COMPETITION

764
00:28:30,046 --> 00:28:31,314
FOR A FIGHT.

765
00:28:31,515 --> 00:28:34,017
IT SEEMS REALLY PETTY
TO BE ARGUING OVER SOMETHING

766
00:28:34,017 --> 00:28:35,552
LIKE--LIKE THIS.

767
00:28:35,552 --> 00:28:36,653
IT'S NOT EVEN ABOUT THAT.

768
00:28:36,820 --> 00:28:40,023
IT'S ABOUT EVERY DAY,
EVERY DAY A GROUP OF GIRLS

769
00:28:40,023 --> 00:28:41,491
COME AT BRANDY
WITH SOMETHING.

770
00:28:41,491 --> 00:28:43,226
EVERYBODY WANNA
GANG UP ON BRANDY.

771
00:28:43,226 --> 00:28:44,528
BRANDY--SHE DOES SOMETHING.

772
00:28:44,528 --> 00:28:46,329
YEAH, MOST OF THE TIME,
SHE'S WRONG.

773
00:28:46,496 --> 00:28:47,164
SO WHAT?

774
00:28:47,998 --> 00:28:50,333
BUT I DO PROTECT HER BECAUSE
THAT'S MY LITTLE SISTER NOW.

775
00:28:50,600 --> 00:28:51,902
I HAVEN'T BEEN
TO ANGER MANAGEMENT,

776
00:28:51,902 --> 00:28:53,437
BUT I'M NOT GONNA LET NOBODY
JUST KEEP COMIN' AT ME

777
00:28:53,437 --> 00:28:54,571
WITH ANGRINESS.

778
00:28:54,671 --> 00:28:56,406
THAT'S WHY SHE'S ALWAYS ANGRY,
'CAUSE EVERYBODY

779
00:28:56,406 --> 00:28:57,674
KEEPS COMING ON HER
WITH NEGATIVITY.

780
00:28:57,941 --> 00:29:00,010
SHE SAYS STAY OUT OF HER FACE,
STAY OUT OF HER FACE.

781
00:29:00,010 --> 00:29:01,845
BRANDY BRINGS OUT
THE OLD TIFFANY,

782
00:29:02,012 --> 00:29:03,747
ME GIVIN' ATTITUDE
TO THE OTHER GIRLS

783
00:29:03,747 --> 00:29:05,348
BECAUSE OF SOMETHING
SHE DID.

784
00:29:05,348 --> 00:29:06,783
ALL Y'ALL BITCHES EVIL.

785
00:29:14,624 --> 00:29:16,626
YOU KNOW SHE'S ANGRY,
WHY PROVOKE HER?

786
00:29:16,626 --> 00:29:18,628
WHY SAY SOMETHING TO HER
THAT'S GONNA PROVOKE HER

787
00:29:18,628 --> 00:29:19,629
TO WANNA SLAP YOU?

788
00:29:19,629 --> 00:29:21,064
- JUST LEAVE HER ALONE.
- I AGREE.

789
00:29:21,064 --> 00:29:24,668
PEOPLE ASKED ME WHAT HAPPENED
AND I VOICED MY STORY

790
00:29:24,668 --> 00:29:26,036
JUST LIKE ANYBODY WOULD DO.

791
00:29:26,169 --> 00:29:27,437
WELL, GREAT, IT'S OVER.
WE CAN GO HOME NOW.

792
00:29:27,437 --> 00:29:28,305
YEAH, IT'S FINE.

793
00:29:29,206 --> 00:29:30,373
IT DON'T
MAKE NO SENSE OF FUSSIN',

794
00:29:30,373 --> 00:29:31,842
IT DON'T MAKE NO SENSE
TO GET NO ATTITUDE.

795
00:29:31,842 --> 00:29:33,910
I'M SAYING THAT IF YOU'VE
GOT SOMETHING TO SAY TO THEM,

796
00:29:33,910 --> 00:29:36,146
SAY IT,
BUT DON'T GO IN NOBODY'S FACE.

797
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,247
DON'T THREATEN THEM.

798
00:29:37,948 --> 00:29:40,717
TIFFANY USED TO BE
VERY ANGRY AND VERY VIOLENT,

799
00:29:41,184 --> 00:29:45,589
AND NOW I SEE HER A LOT OF TIMES
AS BEING VERY PROTECTIVE

800
00:29:45,789 --> 00:29:46,656
AND VERY MOTHERLY.

801
00:29:48,358 --> 00:29:49,192
TYRA MAIL!

802
00:29:49,493 --> 00:29:51,595
"TOMORROW YOU WILL
MEET WITH THE JUDGES.

803
00:29:51,761 --> 00:29:53,763
ONLY 11 OF YOU
WILL CONTINUE ..."

804
00:29:53,763 --> 00:29:56,967
"...ON THE ROAD OF BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL."

805
00:29:57,567 --> 00:29:58,568
ONE WILL BE ELIMINATED?

806
00:29:58,568 --> 00:29:59,503
YES.

807
00:29:59,769 --> 00:30:02,138
IT'S TO THAT POINT
WHERE EVERYBODY'S SHOWING

808
00:30:02,138 --> 00:30:02,939
THEIR TRUE COLORS.

809
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:05,275
IT'S ABOUT TO BE
ONLY 11 PEOPLE REMAINING,

810
00:30:05,375 --> 00:30:07,511
AND YOU CAN'T FAKE
FOR TOO LONG.

811
00:30:09,246 --> 00:30:10,080
I HAVE A NEW STRATEGY.

812
00:30:10,547 --> 00:30:11,681
I'M BEING TIFFANY.

813
00:30:11,848 --> 00:30:13,917
THEY COULD EITHER LOVE IT
OR HATE ME FOR IT.

814
00:30:21,858 --> 00:30:23,560
NOW IT'S TIME
TO MAKE OUR THIRD CUT

815
00:30:23,560 --> 00:30:25,295
WHICH WILL BRING US
ONE STEP CLOSER TOWARDS

816
00:30:25,295 --> 00:30:28,899
DETERMINING WHO WILL BECOME
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

817
00:30:29,065 --> 00:30:31,468
NOW, YOU ALL KNOW WE HAVE
SOME AMAZING PRIZES, RIGHT?

818
00:30:31,468 --> 00:30:34,471
THE FIRST IS A CONTRACT
WITH THE TOP INTERNATIONAL

819
00:30:34,471 --> 00:30:37,374
MODELING MANAGEMENT COMPANY
FORD MODELS,

820
00:30:37,374 --> 00:30:40,176
A SPREAD IN ELLE MAGAZINE
WHICH WILL BE SHOT

821
00:30:40,176 --> 00:30:43,013
BY WORLD RENOWNED PHOTOGRAPHER
GILLES BENSIMON,

822
00:30:43,013 --> 00:30:48,184
AND A $100,000 CONTRACT
WITH COVER GIRL COSMETICS.

823
00:30:48,184 --> 00:30:51,354
AND OF COURSE WE HAVE
OUR CRAZY JUDGES--

824
00:30:51,488 --> 00:30:52,889
MISS JANICE DICKINSON,
ONE OF THE WORLD'S

825
00:30:52,889 --> 00:30:55,225
FIRST SUPERMODELS,
NIGEL BARKER,

826
00:30:55,225 --> 00:30:57,561
A NOTED FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER,
NOLE MARIN,

827
00:30:57,561 --> 00:30:59,763
A PROMINENT FASHION EDITOR
AND STYLIST,

828
00:30:59,763 --> 00:31:03,133
AND OUR SPECIAL GUEST JUDGE
MISS BEVERLY JOHNSON.

829
00:31:03,133 --> 00:31:04,935
BEVERLY IS TOTALLY
ONE OF MY IDOLS.

830
00:31:04,935 --> 00:31:06,870
THIS IS ONE OF THE WOMEN
THAT MADE ME WANT TO MODEL.

831
00:31:06,870 --> 00:31:08,104
AW.

832
00:31:08,104 --> 00:31:10,440
SO, NOW IT'S TIME
FOR YOUR INDIVIDUAL EVALUATIONS.

833
00:31:10,440 --> 00:31:12,742
I GOT A LITTLE FEEDBACK
THAT YOU GUYS HAD A SHOOT

834
00:31:12,742 --> 00:31:14,945
WITH A PHOTOGRAPHER
FROM HELL.

835
00:31:15,779 --> 00:31:17,514
BUT WHAT
YOU GUYS DIDN'T KNOW

836
00:31:17,514 --> 00:31:21,551
WAS THAT THAT SHOOT WAS YOUR
ACTUAL TEST FOR JUDGING TODAY,

837
00:31:21,551 --> 00:31:23,520
AND, MICHELLE,
YOU'RE FIRST.

838
00:31:23,987 --> 00:31:24,955
LET'S SEE IT.

839
00:31:25,822 --> 00:31:28,058
- OOH.
- OH, MY GOSH.

840
00:31:28,391 --> 00:31:30,660
NO MATTER WHAT HAPPENS,
YOU ARE TO ALWAYS REMEMBER

841
00:31:30,660 --> 00:31:31,761
YOU'RE MODELING.

842
00:31:31,761 --> 00:31:34,130
YOU ALSO HAD A SHOOT
IN THE HEAVENS.

843
00:31:34,130 --> 00:31:36,733
HERE IS MICHELLE'S
BEST SHOT.

844
00:31:36,733 --> 00:31:39,302
- WHOA.
- OOH, GORGEOUS.

845
00:31:39,302 --> 00:31:41,938
THAT IS ABSOLUTELY
SPARKADELICIOUS.

846
00:31:41,938 --> 00:31:42,973
OUT OF THIS WORLD.

847
00:31:42,973 --> 00:31:44,474
OKAY, UP NEXT,
WE HAVE NAIMA.

848
00:31:44,474 --> 00:31:47,911
THE GREAT THING ABOUT THIS
IS THERE'S JUNK HAPPENING,

849
00:31:47,911 --> 00:31:50,280
BUT YOU'RE STILL
AWARE OF THE PHOTOGRAPHER.

850
00:31:50,280 --> 00:31:51,982
SO, NAIMA,
YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT.

851
00:31:51,982 --> 00:31:55,785
GOING THROUGH YOUR FILM, THIS IS
ACTUALLY YOUR BEST BODY POSE,

852
00:31:55,785 --> 00:31:57,621
AND I WAS A LITTLE
DISAPPOINTED BECAUSE

853
00:31:57,621 --> 00:31:59,089
YOU'RE THE BALLERINA GIRL.

854
00:31:59,089 --> 00:32:01,758
I DON'T REALLY KNOW
WHAT YOU WERE SAYING

855
00:32:01,758 --> 00:32:03,560
WITH THAT EXPRESSION.

856
00:32:04,127 --> 00:32:05,795
ALL RIGHT, TATIANA,
SO YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT

857
00:32:05,795 --> 00:32:06,963
WITH THE PHOTOGRAPHER
FROM HELL.

858
00:32:06,963 --> 00:32:08,698
THAT'S A LITTLE
OVER-THE-TOP.

859
00:32:08,698 --> 00:32:11,635
THAT ONE, TO ME, IS LIKE,
"I'M GONNA KICK YOUR ASS."

860
00:32:11,635 --> 00:32:13,036
I QUITE LIKE THAT.

861
00:32:13,036 --> 00:32:14,704
HERE'S YOUR BEST SHOT.

862
00:32:14,704 --> 00:32:16,006
- THAT'S BEAUTIFUL.
- YEAH.

863
00:32:16,006 --> 00:32:18,675
GREAT BODY, BABY.
DOUBLE TROUBLE.

864
00:32:19,509 --> 00:32:20,577
NEXT WE HAVE BRITTANY.

865
00:32:20,577 --> 00:32:21,845
FIRST OFF,
I JUST WANT TO TELL YOU

866
00:32:21,845 --> 00:32:24,514
YOU LOOK SO BEAUTIFUL.

867
00:32:24,514 --> 00:32:25,649
THANK YOU.

868
00:32:25,649 --> 00:32:26,816
YOU NEED TO BECOME
A LITTLE BIT MORE

869
00:32:26,816 --> 00:32:29,552
ELEGANT AND GRACEFUL
IN FRONT OF THE CAMERA

870
00:32:29,552 --> 00:32:31,121
AND OFF THE CAMERA.

871
00:32:31,121 --> 00:32:33,156
AND HERE
IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

872
00:32:33,156 --> 00:32:34,958
THIS WOULD HAVE BEEN
AN EASY SHOOT

873
00:32:34,958 --> 00:32:36,059
TO HAVE GONE PLAYBOY.

874
00:32:36,059 --> 00:32:38,294
I DON'T SEE PLAYBOY
THIS WEEK.

875
00:32:38,628 --> 00:32:40,363
- I SEE A MODEL.
- ABSOLUTELY.

876
00:32:41,197 --> 00:32:43,066
ALL RIGHTY, UP NEXT,
WE HAVE BRANDY.

877
00:32:43,199 --> 00:32:45,135
- HI, BRANDY.
- HI, BRANDY.

878
00:32:45,135 --> 00:32:46,169
BRANDY, YOU SEEM SAD.

879
00:32:46,169 --> 00:32:47,771
OH, NO, I'M NOT SAD.

880
00:32:47,771 --> 00:32:50,340
I JUST BE CONCENTRATIN',
LIKE, ON THE PICTURES.

881
00:32:50,340 --> 00:32:52,676
DURING THE AUDITIONS
YOU CAME IN THERE.

882
00:32:52,676 --> 00:32:54,344
YOU WERE SO BUBBLY.

883
00:32:54,344 --> 00:32:56,946
YOU WERE SO BRIGHT AND HAPPY
AND IT'S THIS GREAT PERSONALITY

884
00:32:56,946 --> 00:32:59,549
AND IT'S WHAT GOT YOU HERE,
AND WHAT'S GONNA SEND YOU HOME

885
00:32:59,549 --> 00:33:01,451
IS THE NEGATIVE ATTITUDE,
'CAUSE YOU TAKE

886
00:33:01,451 --> 00:33:02,552
BEAUTIFUL PICTURES.

